{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國男神池昌旭夥拍日本女星今田美櫻合演日劇《愛上草莓的季節》，雖然在日本本土收視麻麻，但在串流平台全球首播觀看次數稱冠。</p><p>在最新播放的第4集更上映兩人的甜蜜咀戲。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;故事講述今田飾演的士多啤梨果農在慶典</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:13.473449+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T03:03:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_hash":"fb5b7b2d7893adc7656d5551f54e052f2dc1d74ca078844bf2a99f14de5f88ec","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}